{"speciesId":626,"names":{"fr":"Frison","es":"Bouffalant","en":"Bouffalant","ja":"バッフロン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son pelage fourni absorbe les chocs et lui permet d’asséner sans broncher le plus violent des coups de tête."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Their fluffy fur absorbs damage, even if they strike foes with a fierce headbutt."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il charge tout ce qui bouge sans réfléchir. Il peut faire dérailler un train en marche."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They charge wildly and headbutt everything. Their headbutts have enough destructive force to derail a train."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They are known to charge so wildly that if a train were to enter their territory, they would send it flying."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They are known to charge so wildly that if a train were to enter their territory, they would send it flying."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il charge tout ce qui bouge sans réfléchir. Il peut faire dérailler un train en marche."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Embiste con la cabeza sin distinción. Su potencia es capaz de hacer descarrilar un tren en marcha."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They charge wildly and headbutt everything. Their headbutts have enough destructive force to derail a train."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"見境なく 突進して 頭突きを 食らわせる。走っている 列車を 脱線させる 破壊力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son pelage fourni absorbe les chocs et lui permet d’asséner sans broncher le plus violent des coups de tête."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Aunque encaje un cabezazo violento, su pelaje absorbe el daño."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Their fluffy fur absorbs damage, even if they strike foes with a fierce headbutt."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"激しい 頭突きを 食らわせても ふさふさの 体毛が ダメージを 吸収して くれるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il charge tout ce qui bouge sans réfléchir. Il peut faire dérailler un train en marche."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Embiste con la cabeza sin distinción. Su potencia es capaz de hacer descarrilar un tren en marcha."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They charge wildly and headbutt everything. Their headbutts have enough destructive force to derail a train."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"見境なく 突進して 頭突きを 食らわせる。走っている 列車を 脱線させる 破壊力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Son pelage fourni absorbe les chocs et lui permet d’asséner sans broncher le plus violent des coups de tête."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aunque encaje un cabezazo violento, su pelaje absorbe el daño."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Their fluffy fur absorbs damage, even if they strike foes with a fierce headbutt."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"激しい 頭突きを 食らわせても ふさふさの 体毛が ダメージを 吸収して くれるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il peut détruire une voiture d’un coup de tête. Plus sa crinière est volumineuse, plus son rang au sein du troupeau est élevé."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Puede destrozar un coche de un solo testarazo. Cuanto más abundante sea su melena, mayor rango tendrá en la jerarquía de la manada."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"These Pokémon can crush a car with no more than a headbutt. Bouffalant with more hair on their heads hold higher positions within the herd."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"頭突きだけで 車を 潰す。 頭の 毛が 大きいほど 群れでの 地位が 上がるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les Frison vivent en troupeau d’une vingtaine d’individus. Pour une raison inconnue, si l’un d’eux trahit le groupe, il perd sa crinière."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Forman manadas de unos veinte individuos. Se desconoce el motivo, pero los que traicionan la confianza del grupo pierden la melena."},{"language":"en